        <paragraph>Camping Rene is on an Alpine hike. The temperature is $$- \textbf{7}\textbf{^\circ }.$$ Rene’s sleeping bag is rated “comfortable to $$- \textbf{20} \text{°”.}$$ How much can the temperature change before it is too cold for Rene’s sleeping bag?</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>13°</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
